# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, professional, production-ready car rental management system called **TRANSCAR** for a car rental agency located in Blida, Algeria.

The project must include:

1. A complete Windows desktop administration application.
2. A separate customer-facing car booking website.
3. A centralized production database.
4. Secure cloud document and image storage.
5. Complete rental management.
6. Vehicle and customer management.
7. Official rental contract generation.
8. Official rental conditions management.
9. Financial management and cash register.
10. Maintenance and document expiry monitoring.
11. Automatic notifications.
12. Multi-computer synchronization.
13. A real Windows installer named `TRANSCAR-Setup.exe`.

This is a complete business application, not a prototype.

**IMPORTANT:** If existing TRANSCAR source code is supplied, inspect and extend the existing project instead of creating an unrelated replacement. Preserve existing functionality, data, architecture and working integrations wherever possible.

Do not remove working features without explicit authorization.

